; BQ78350 Current Calibration Sequence

; 1. Enter CAL mode (MAC 0x002D)
B 0x44 0x2D 0x00
X 170

; 2. Check CAL_EN 1
CHK_CAL 1

; 3. Raw ADC MODE start (MAC 0xF082)
B 0x44 0x82 0xF0
X 230

; 4. Read Raw ADC 6 times (200ms apart)
A 0x44 200 6
X 10

; 5. Raw ADC MODE stop (MAC 0xF080)
B 0x44 0x80 0xF0
X 160

; 6. Save Current Calibration Data (updates 0x4000 block)
S 0x4000
X 250

; 7. Disable CAL mode (MAC 0x002D)
B 0x44 0x2D 0x00
X 60

; 8. Check CAL_EN 0
CHK_CAL 0
